%N A397951 Number of tilings of a 4 X n rectangle using L and T tetrominoes that are indecomposable with respect to the second dimension.
%H A397951 Paolo Xausa, <a href="/A397951/b397951.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..1000</a>
%H A397951 <a href="/index/Rec#order_06">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (0,2,0,1,0,2).
%F A397951 a(n) = 2*a(n-2) + a(n-4) + 2*a(n-6), for n > 12.
%F A397951 Limit_{n -> oo} a(n)^(1/n) = sqrt(1 + A348909) = 1.6306339509273668...
%F A397951 G.f.: -8*x + 6*x^2 + 4*x^3 - 2*x^4 + 4*x^6 + 2*x*(2 - 2*x + x^2)*(2 + x - 4*x^2)/(1 - 2*x^2 - x^4 - 2*x^6).
